Package: govox-rs
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Rocky Burt <rocky.burt@gmail.com>
Depends: ydotool, wl-clipboard
Provides: govox
Conflicts: govox-py
Replaces: govox-py
Description: Wayland-first speech-to-text dictation daemon
 govox provides local-first dictation for Wayland desktops with ydotool
 injection and clipboard fallback.
 .
 This is the Rust implementation. It reserves the same Provides: govox as
 govox-py and declares the reciprocal Conflicts/Replaces, so exactly one of
 the two can be installed — which is what stops two daemons grabbing the same
 evdev devices and registering the same IBus engine.
 .
 Architecture is amd64 rather than all: this ships a compiled binary with
 whisper.cpp linked in. No python3 dependency, and no PyGObject, IBus typelib
 or ONNX Runtime either — the Silero model and its runtime are compiled in,
 and IBus and AT-SPI are reached over D-Bus rather than through libraries.
